{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_drain_beam_segment","model_identifier":"spell_drain_beam_segment","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_drain_beam_segment\n\nDrain beam segment: a short deep-purple tube 16 u long with darker pulsing bands. Origin at one end (z = 0), runs to z = -16; the game stretches it between caster and target.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -2..2, y -2..2, z -16..0 units (0.13 x 0.13 x 0.45 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 32 x 32, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 6.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 5 x 5 x 16 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z -8\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `loop` | 0.8 | loop | dark bands pulse along the tube toward the caster (+Z), one band spacing per loop |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_band0, glow_band1, glow_band2, glow_band3, glow_core, glow_tube\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n- The band texture also streams if the game scrolls V.\n"},"resolution":{"width":32,"height":32},"elements":[{"name":"glow_tube","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-2.0,-2.0,-16.0],"to":[2.0,2.0,0.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,18.0,4.0,22.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,32.0,4.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,18.0,4.0,22.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[16.0,0.0,32.0,4.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[2.0,0.0,6.0,16.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[2.0,0.0,6.0,16.0],"tex